.TH ULTRACOPY 1 "2026" "UltraCopy" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
ultracopy \- safe GUI file copier with SHA-256 verification
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B ultracopy
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B ultracopy
starts the UltraCopy graphical file copier.
Files and folders are copied into a hidden staging folder on the destination
file system, verified with SHA-256 by re-reading the destination from disk,
committed with fsync/syncfs, and then published without overwriting any
existing item.
.PP
Copy history is stored in
.IR ~/.local/share/ultracopy/history.sqlite3 .
.SH SEE ALSO
https://github.com/kenjiiida-commits/UltraCopy
